    "text": "<p>We know that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2.303</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>so for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>hence <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>;</mo></math></p><p>for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math></p><p>for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
